      "id": "lesson-1711-p1:p1",
      "text": "劝 学\n\n《荀子》\n\n君子曰：学不可以已。青，取之于蓝，而青于蓝；冰，水为之，而寒于水。木直中绳，𫐓以为轮，其曲中规。虽有槁暴，不复挺者，𫐓使之然也。故木受绳则直，金就砺则利，君子博学而日参省乎己，则知明而行无过矣。\n\n吾尝终日而思矣，不如须臾之所学也；吾尝跂而望矣，不如登高之博见也。登高而招，臂非加长也，而见者远；顺风而呼，声非加疾也，而闻者彰。假舆马者，非利足也，而致千里；假舟楫者，非能水也，而绝江河。君子生非异也，善假于物也。\n\n积土成山，风雨兴焉；积水成渊，蛟龙生焉；积善成德，而神明自得，圣心备焉。故不积跬步，无以至千里；不积小流，无以成江海。骐骥一跃，不能十步；驽马十驾，功在不舍。锲而舍之，朽木不折；锲而不舍，金石可镂。蚓无爪牙之利，筋骨之强，上食埃土，下饮黄泉，用心一也。蟹六跪而二螯，非蛇鳝之穴无可寄托者，用心躁也。",
      "block": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "劝 学",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[1]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-1",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n《荀子》\n\n君子",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[2]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-2",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "曰：学不可以已。青，取之于蓝",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[3]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-3",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，而青于蓝",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[4]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-4",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "；冰，水为之，而寒于水。木直中绳",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[5]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-5",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，𫐓以",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[6]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-6",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "为轮，其曲中规",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[7]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-7",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "。虽有槁暴",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[8]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-8",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，不复挺",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[9]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-9",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "者，𫐓使之然也。故木受绳",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[10]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-10",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "则直，金",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[11]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-11",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "就砺",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[12]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-12",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "则利，君子博学而日参省乎己",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[13]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-13",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，则知",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[14]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-14",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "明而行无过矣。\n\n吾尝终日而思矣，不如须臾之所学也；吾尝跂",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[15]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-15",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "而望矣，不如登高之博见也。登高而招，臂非加长也，而见者远",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[16]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-16",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "；顺风而呼，声非加疾",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[17]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-17",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "也，而闻者彰",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[18]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-18",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "。假",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[19]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-19",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "舆马",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[20]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-20",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "者，非利足",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[21]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-21",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "也，而致",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[22]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-22",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "千里；假舟楫者，非能水",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[23]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-23",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "也，而绝",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[24]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-24",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "江河。君子生非异",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[25]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-25",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "也，善假于物",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[26]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-26",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "也。\n\n积土成山，风雨兴焉",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[27]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-27",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "；积水成渊，蛟龙生焉；积善成德，而神明",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[28]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-28",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "自得，圣心",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[29]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-29",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "备焉。故不积跬步",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[30]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-30",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，无以",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[31]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-31",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "至千里；不积小流，无以成江海。骐骥",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[32]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-32",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "一跃，不能十步；驽马十驾",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[33]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-33",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，功在不舍",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[34]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-34",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "。锲",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[35]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-35",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "而舍之，朽木不折；锲而不舍，金石可镂",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[36]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-36",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "。蚓无爪牙之利，筋骨之强，上食埃土",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[37]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-37",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，下饮黄泉",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[38]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-38",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，用心一",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[39]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-39",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "也。蟹六跪",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[40]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-40",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "而二螯",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[41]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-41",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "，非蛇鳝之穴无可寄托者，用心躁",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "label": "[42]",
            "noteId": "footnote-11143-42",
            "type": "annotation-ref"
          },
          {
            "text": "也。",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
