      "noteId": "footnote-11143-22"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "能水：善于游水。水，游泳。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-23"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "绝：横渡。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-24"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "生（xìng）非异：天性（同一般人）没有差别。生，同“性”，天性。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-25"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "物：外物，包括各种客观条件。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-26"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "兴焉：在这里兴起。兴，起。焉，兼词，相当于“于此”。下文“生焉”的“焉”同此。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-27"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "神明：非凡的智慧。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-28"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "圣心：圣人的心怀。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-29"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "跬（kuǐ）步：古代称跨出一脚为“跬”，跨出两脚为“步”。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-30"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "无以：没有用来……的，无从。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-31"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "骐骥（qíjì）：骏马。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-32"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "驽马十驾：劣马拉车走十天。驾，一天的行程。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-33"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "功在不舍：功效来源于走个不停。舍，停止、止息。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-34"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "锲（qiè）：刻。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-35"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "镂：雕刻。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-36"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "埃土：泥土，尘土。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-37"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "黄泉：地下的泉水。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-38"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "一：专一。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-39"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "六跪：蟹的六条腿。“六”应是“八”。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-40"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "螯：蟹钳。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11143-41"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
